From 663d1560b0dfe181ee07bd5b99c03f0e7aef7dca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bill <bill@yuan.com.tw>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 11:45:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(fsbl): add Si5341 clock generator configuration

Implement initialization of the Si5341 Rev B clock generator within the
FSBL hook after bitstream download.

- Add Si5341-RevB-SC6F0-Ultra-V1_1-Registers.h containing the register
  map exported from ClockBuilder Pro (Ultra V1_1, 2026-09-15), aligned
  with the RX/TX FSBL configuration so all three projects share the same
  settings header file.
- Add xfsbl_hooks.c I2C write helpers and the XFsbl_HookAfterBSDownload
  hook body to program the Si5341 register map after bitstream download.
  I2C is configured at 100 kHz using the device at address 0x76.
---
 .../Si5341-RevB-SC6F0-Ultra-V1_1-Registers.h  | 757 ++++++++++++++++++
 lib/sw_apps/zynqmp_fsbl/src/xfsbl_hooks.c     | 121 ++-
 2 files changed, 873 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)
 create mode 100755 lib/sw_apps/zynqmp_fsbl/src/Si5341-RevB-SC6F0-Ultra-V1_1-Registers.h

